{
  "uid": "jobbi-prueba-08",
  "title": "8 · Estrés · punto de quiebre 75 → 350 TPS",
  "description": "Guía: docs/guia-de-pruebas.md · Punto 10.4 · Escenario 3 Estrés y Rúbrica Punto 3 (punto de quiebre).",
  "tags": [
    "jobbi",
    "pruebas"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Qué es esta prueba",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Comando:** `./scripts/caos/estres-punto-de-quiebre.sh`  \n**Caso del documento:** Punto 10.4 · Escenario 3 Estrés y Rúbrica Punto 3 (punto de quiebre).\n\n**Qué deberías ver:** escalones en **Rate** que se «aplanan» en el máximo que el sistema alcanza; en **CPU** qué servicio llega primero al 100 % (se espera el gateway); el **p95** muy por encima de la línea roja y los **Errores** que aparecen; la recuperación al volver a 12 TPS.\n\n**Criterio de éxito:** documentar el TPS de quiebre, el primer recurso saturado y el tiempo de recuperación, sin perder dinero.\n\nAntes de empezar: `./scripts/reiniciar-entorno.sh`. No interrumpas el script en las esperas."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rate · solicitudes por segundo (gateway)",
      "description": "Throughput por endpoint del caso de uso. Nominal ≈ 12 TPS.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count{service=\"gateway\", route=~\".*check-out|.*check-in|.*acuerdos.*|.*billeteras.*|.*cobro\"}[20s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count{service=\"gateway\"}[20s]))",
          "legendFormat": "TOTAL gateway",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duration · latencia del gateway (p50 / p95 / p99)",
      "description": "SLO p95 < 400 ms (línea roja). Mira el p95.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\"}[20s]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\"}[20s]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\"}[20s]))) * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 400
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU · % del límite por servicio",
      "description": "Al llegar al 100 %, Kubernetes frena el servicio (throttling).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (container) (100 * sum by (namespace, pod, container) (node_namespace_pod_container:container_cpu_usage_seconds_total:sum_rate{namespace=\"aws-local\"}) / on (namespace, pod, container) sum by (namespace, pod, container) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"aws-local\", resource=\"cpu\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors · % de respuestas 5xx por servicio",
      "description": "SLO < 1 % (línea roja).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum by (service) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count{status=~\"5..\"}[20s])) or 0 * sum by (service) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count[20s]))) / (sum by (service) (rate(jobbi_http_request_duration_seconds_count[20s])) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
